				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Element): Sync submodule updates with dependency bumps and Mountain extension roots\n\nSynchronize seven Element submodules to their latest downstream versions:\n- Cocoon: Bump OpenTelemetry devDependencies (sdk-trace-node, exporter-trace-otlp-http, sdk-trace-base, sdk-logs, sdk-metrics, sdk-trace-web)\n- Common: Bump @cloudflare/workers-types to 4.20260430.1\n- Echo: Bump @cloudflare/workers-types to 4.20260430.1\n- Mountain: Revert to simple Mountain naming and add extension_root allowlist for Land and VSCode extension directories\n- Wind: Bump OpenTelemetry devDependencies and reformat ESBuild config/output to readable multi-line format\n- Worker: Bump @types/serviceworker and expand ESBuild configuration from minified to readable format\n- Output: Sync point\n\nThe Mountain extension_root allowlist enables the `/Extension/<abs-fs-path>` URL prefix to serve extension-contributed assets (icons, webview resources) from ~/.land/extensions and ~/.vscode/extensions, fixing missing icons for sideloaded extensions like GitLens.",
			"SHA": "9b8bab2887f5ff3ffe183f2525292c3f648618a6"
		}
